<view class="page zip-page cycle-page"><view class="cycle-hero"><view><view class="zip-title">美丽循环</view><view class="cycle-sub">让美，更循环的发生</view><text>回收 ｜ 再生 ｜ 分享 ｜ 共建更可持续的美丽</text></view><image src="/assets/zip/circular_bottle_eco_1792151344680.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/></view><view class="points-card soft-card"><view><text class="small">本月已回收</text><text class="strong">3 件</text><text class="small">累计减少约 0.8 kg 碳排放</text></view><view><text class="small">累计积分</text><text class="strong">260 分</text></view></view><view class="cycle-actions"><view class="cycle-action recycle" data-t="预约空瓶回收" bindtap="open"><text class="strong">预约空瓶回收</text><text class="small">一键预约，让空瓶重获新生</text><button bindtap="open" data-t="预约空瓶回收">预约回收</button></view><view class="cycle-action dropoff" data-t="空瓶回收点" bindtap="open"><text class="strong">空瓶回收点</text><text class="small">查找附近的回收点</text><button bindtap="open" data-t="空瓶回收点">查看回收点</button></view><view class="cycle-action points" data-t="积分兑换" bindtap="open"><text class="strong">积分兑换</text><text class="small">用行动兑换更多美好</text><button bindtap="open" data-t="积分兑换">积分兑换</button></view><view class="cycle-action community" data-t="社区" bindtap="open"><text class="strong">绿色社区</text><text class="small">分享故事，连接同频伙伴</text><button bindtap="open" data-t="社区">社区</button></view></view><view class="community-card soft-card"><image src="/assets/zip/beauty_circular_recycle_1792080329011.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><text class="strong">闲置不闲，让美继续发光</text><button class="zip-primary" bindtap="community">去社区看看</button></view><view class="record-card soft-card"><text class="strong">最近回收记录</text><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id"><text>{{item.date}} · {{item.item_name}}</text><text class="success">{{item.status}} +{{item.points}}分</text></view></view><bottom-nav active-key="cycle"/></view>